Task: Tell me all 2-hop transaction paths on the Zilliqa blockchain from the address zil1jrpjd8pjuv50cfkfr7eu6yrm3rn5u8rulqhqpz to the address zil19nmxkh020jnequql9kvqkf3pkwm0j0spqtd26e. Exclude intermediary addresses with over 50 outgoing transactions to avoid exchanges and active wallets. Display each path in the following format: <from_address> --(tx <first5_chars_of_transaction_id>..)--> <intermediate_address> --(tx <first5_chars_of_transaction_id>..)--> <end_address>

Please answer only one complete SQL in snowflake dialect in ```sql``` format.
